  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project supports member countries to meet their national and international ocean related commitments. Member countries are supported to implement the goals of the Commonwealth Blue Charter (CBC) through the transfer of technology and best practices through action groups; capacity building through knowledge sharing; international cooperation and collaboration; development of pilot projects; and technical assistance.???</narrative>
